Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Every night I live and die \N♪ 每个夜晚我都在生死间徘徊 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the party to my bones \N♪ 感受派对深入骨髓 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the wasters blow the speakers \N♪ 看着废物们震坏音响设备 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.05,0:00:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Spill my guts beneath the outdoor light \N♪ 在户外灯光下倾吐心声 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just another graceless night \N♪ 又一个狼狈无措的夜晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate the headlines and the weather \N♪ 我讨厌头条新闻和天气 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 19 and I'm on fire \N♪ 十九岁的我正染着热血 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But when we're dancing I'm alright \N♪ 但当我们起舞时 我才感觉自在 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just another graceless night \N♪ 又一个狼狈无措的夜晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you lost enough? \N♪ 你是否已足够迷茫？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Have another drink get lost in us \N♪ 再来一杯 迷失在我们之中 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how we get notorious oh \N♪ 这就是我们声名狼藉的方式 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I don't know \N♪ 因为我不知道 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If they keep tellin' me where to go \N♪ 如果他们一直告诉我该何去何从 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll blow my brains out to the radio oh \N♪ 我会随着广播音乐崩溃疯狂 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.13,0:00:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the things we're taking \N♪ 我们攫取的一切 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause we are young and we're ashamed \N♪ 因为我们年轻且羞愧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.05,0:01:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Send us to perfect places \N♪ 将我们送去往完美之地吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our heroes fading \N♪ 所有的英雄都已逝去 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can't stand to be alone \N♪ 现在我无法忍受独自一人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to perfect places \N♪ 让我们前往完美之地 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.18,0:01:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Every night I live and die \N♪ 每个夜晚我都在生死间徘徊 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet somebody take 'em home \N♪ 遇见某人 带他们回家 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kiss and then take off our clothes \N♪ 让我们亲吻然后脱去衣裳 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.96,0:01:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just another graceless night \N♪ 又一个狼狈无措的夜晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.62,0:01:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the things we're taking \N♪ 我们攫取的一切 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.49,0:02:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause we are young and we're ashamed \N♪ 因为我们年轻且羞愧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Send us to perfect places \N♪ 将我们送去往完美之地吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our heroes fading \N♪ 所有的英雄都已逝去 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can't stand to be alone \N♪ 现在我无法忍受独自一人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.37,0:02:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to perfect places \N♪ 让我们前往完美之地 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All the nights spent off our faces \N♪ 所有那些我们醉生梦死的夜晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.33,0:02:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to find these perfect places \N♪ 试图寻找这些完美之地 ♪
